[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/534948134","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3132#issuecomment-534948134","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3132","id":534948134,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNDk0ODEzNA==","user":{"login":"lesurp","id":12513150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTEzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12513150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp","html_url":"https://github.com/lesurp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-09-25T09:58:44Z","updated_at":"2019-09-25T09:58:44Z","body":"Note: it seems the bug is actually because pylint treats the `if __name__ == '__main__'` as module level code e.g.:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport random\r\n\r\n\r\ndef compute(number):\r\n    return 2 * number\r\n\r\n\r\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\r\n    number = random.randint(1, 10)\r\n```\r\n\r\nproduces:\r\n```\r\n************* Module ok\r\nok.py:1:0: C0114: Missing module docstring (missing-module-docstring)\r\nok.py:4:0: C0116: Missing function or method docstring (missing-function-docstring)\r\nok.py:4:12: W0621: Redefining name 'number' from outer scope (line 9) (redefined-outer-name)\r\nok.py:9:4: C0103: Constant name \"number\" doesn't conform to UPPER_CASE naming style (invalid-name)\r\n\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nYour code has been rated at 2.00/10 (previous run: 2.00/10, +0.00)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe re-use of `number` should be fine here, but we have `Redefining name 'number' from outer scope (line 9) (redefined-outer-name)`","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/534948134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"lesurp","id":12513150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTEzMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12513150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp","html_url":"https://github.com/lesurp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lesurp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/535382376","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3132#issuecomment-535382376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3132","id":535382376,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUzNTM4MjM3Ng==","user":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCMantic